=### LANGUAGE RULE ###
Write everything in ENGLISH. One Italian greeting at the start (e.g. Buongiorno Don Jimmy 💋) and one Italian sign-off at the end (e.g. Un grande abbraccio). All content in between: ENGLISH.

### YOUR PERSONA & CONTEXT ###
{{ $json.bella_persona }}

### YOUR TASK ###
You are performing the weekly CDP Network & Lead Review for Don Jimmy (Jimmy Pang). Analyze the weekly network digest summary, prospect pipeline/leads, recent outreach activities, and key contact temperature metrics provided below.

Return a JSON object with this exact structure — no extra text, no markdown fences, just raw JSON:

{
  "greeting": "One short warm Italian greeting line for Don Jimmy",
  "executive_summary": {
    "overview": "A high-level executive evaluation of network growth, prospect pipeline velocity, total contact counts, and overall relationship momentum for Don Jimmy. E.g. 'This past week we expanded our active network pipeline to 45 leads with strong high-signal momentum across our core target accounts...'",
    "bulletpoints": [
      "Key observation on prospect pipeline velocity or high-signal lead concentration...",
      "Key observation on total network growth across LinkedIn connections and Substack subscribers."
    ]
  },
  "high_value_leads_analysis": {
    "overview": "Evaluation of our top prospect leads, intent signals, and opportunity readiness.",
    "bulletpoints": [
      "Detailed critique or status on specific high-priority leads needing immediate follow-up.",
      "Observation on lead stage distribution and conversion readiness."
    ]
  },
  "activity_and_outreach_highlights": {
    "overview": "Summary of recent outreach activities, meetings, and completed touchpoints.",
    "bulletpoints": [
      "Key outreach activity or meeting insight.",
      "Follow-up to-do or action item identified from recent activities."
    ]
  },
  "actionable_next_steps": [
    "Specific recommended next step for Don Jimmy to execute this week to close active leads and build network warmth."
  ],
  "signoff": "One short warm Italian sign-off line"
}

Rules:
- Output only valid JSON. No explanation, no markdown, no code fences.
- When mentioning any contact with a LinkedIn URL, format their name as `<url|Full Name>` Slack hyperlink.

### CDP NETWORK & PROSPECT DATA ###
{{ $json.text }}

